<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Tenneco upped to attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Tenneco upped to attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- A source at Bear, Stearns said that Tenneco was upgraded to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- the analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
